messages "sauron**To: jamesSubj: web pageDate: Dec 31I've been planning a general HM web page for a while now, and will getdown to actually writing it in the new year once my thesis is finally outof the way.If you have any ideas/suggestions as to what the web page should containin order to attrach new players and server as a centre of information forour existing players/wizards, I would be happy to look at them. You can  email me at dave_m_walter@geocities.com if you would rather send an emailas opposed to a mudmail. I will post a general note on the wizard board   when I am closer to getting this project off the ground, but as you seemedto have ideas about it, I thought I'd ask you now.I'll look forward to hearing from you soon.Sauron**sauron**To: jamesSubj: any word if Herp got the computer i sent him?Date: Feb 16I received an email from him the other day - he has received the machine butis having trouble getting it to boot. You might want to drop him a line tosee if he could use a hand.Sauron**"
